  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51905649d952fb9c",
      "translationZh": "现在事情稍微尘埃落定了——这里写一篇文章，介绍如何在相对中端的硬件上（RTX 4070 12GB + 64GB DDR5-5600 + Gen4 NVMe，运行 Linux）运行 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next（125B-A6B MoE + 51B n-gram 表）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bce03d0e45bd6009",
      "translationZh": "我一开始只有区区 6 tok/s，经过最新补丁和优化后，生成速度已经接近 20 tok/s。你只需要有足够的 RAM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0eadc42223c3dbc8",
      "translationZh": "对我来说，这是目前这台机器所能达到的最高智能水平。由于 VRAM 太少，27B 稠密模型不是可选方案，但对于其他配置，比如拥有 24GB VRAM 的用户，它可能更合理。实际上，它在大多数任务上也超过了 27B 模型，因此非常适合 VRAM 较少、RAM 容量大且速度快的配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f949542e1b1dbb7",
      "translationZh": "PP 仍然有点低，为 300-350 tok/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b1704f42e27d5e3d",
      "translationZh": "使用 AtomicChat 的 4.27 bpw 量化版本 https://huggingface.co/AtomicChat/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-GGUF",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5d7f8d2f142fde4e",
      "translationZh": "Ngram SSD 卸载（lazy-mode）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cdfee1d4ebc07844",
      "translationZh": "--fit on --fit-target 512 有助于自动选择合适的参数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "662f1c4844257b91",
      "translationZh": "Master 分支（19.35 t/s）：包含 MoE 改进的最新提交。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "45e6a47c7f5a2fda",
      "translationZh": "MTP 变体 - PR #28243 + Compact MTP（20.65 t/s）：MTP 支持尚未合并，因此需要应用此 PR，以启用 Daniel Han 的 1.78 GB `shared-Q4_K_M` 紧凑头。结合 `-ncmoe 45`，它的接受率可达 77–96%，并在所有测试任务（编程、摘要生成、创作）中突破 20 t/s 大关。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "428389acf6039337",
      "translationZh": "在显存如此有限的情况下，MTP 带来的提升并不大，因为你必须让出几层的显存空间来存放 MTP 头。只有 MTP 中的 shared + Q4_K_M 组合能带来实际的性能提升。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "081d31548fc7a2d7",
      "translationZh": "使用商业模型来研究、优化和基准测试本地模型的推理性能，帮助非常大（GLM 5.3 flash 搭配 opencode go，Astra、Gemini 3.8 等也同样有帮助）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6902a007032b1be",
      "translationZh": "帖子里还有更多细节（由 AI 辅助撰写）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
